recipe-authoring-command = Author and review a workflow recipe from user steps and actual passing validation runs
recipe-authoring-title = Save a workflow from reviewed work
recipe-authoring-name = Name
recipe-authoring-scope = Scope — one project-relative path per line; no permissions
recipe-authoring-criteria = Completion criteria — one per line; future runs start unverified
recipe-authoring-steps = User-authored steps — one Form: action per line (for example, Flareon: Make the change)
recipe-authoring-path = New .toml export path — existing files never overwrite
recipe-authoring-commands = Choose actual passing validation commands
recipe-authoring-preview = Preview exact portable TOML and historical provenance
recipe-authoring-policy = Author steps yourself; provider output is never copied. Select actual passing runs. Export transfers no authority.
recipe-authoring-neutral = Stay is the default. Read the complete definition and prior-run evidence before y creates a new file.
recipe-authoring-draft-kept = Draft retained in this task and partner while navigating. It is not saved across restart.
recipe-authoring-cancelled = Preview cancelled; no file created. Authoring draft retained.
recipe-authoring-busy = Save the task and settle owned work and storage first. No workflow was exported.
recipe-authoring-changed = Task, owner, evidence or review changed. Preview again; no file created.
recipe-authoring-working = Creating the reviewed new file on the existing storage worker; wait for settlement.
recipe-authoring-saved = New workflow recipe saved. Historical steps are not future verification; nothing executed.
recipe-authoring-limit = Field limit: 4096 UTF-8 bytes. Input was not inserted.
recipe-authoring-menu-hint = Up/Down choose · Enter edit/select · Esc back (draft retained)
recipe-authoring-editor-hint = Ctrl+S done · Tab Done control · Enter newline · Esc retain draft
recipe-authoring-done = Done editing (Tab / Enter)
recipe-authoring-command-hint = Up/Down run · Space/Enter select · o inspect run · Esc done
recipe-authoring-review-hint = Stay: Esc/Enter · PgUp/PgDn inspect · y create only after complete review
recipe-authoring-no-runs = No retained task-owned runs. Run a separately approved root-directory validation command first.
recipe-authoring-evidence = Prior passing observations selected for this export (historical, not current/future verification)
recipe-authoring-definition = Exact inert portable definition — comments describe provenance, not imported evidence
recipe-authoring-output = New file (create-only)
recipe-authoring-empty = (empty)
recipe-authoring-selected = selected
recipe-authoring-eligible = eligible prior passing run
recipe-authoring-unavailable = unavailable for export
recipe-authoring-resize = Resize to at least 60×18; draft retained, export review revoked.
